ody of Stone.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你召回最多 %d 个蜘蛛机器人，在你的身边形成一个保护屏障，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t蜘蛛机器人有 %d 点生命值，会依次承受伤害。如果被摧毁，他们会完全承受摧毁他们的那一击伤害。\n\t\t如果你激活了低温掘进，被摧毁的机器人会跳向攻击你的敌人，然后在那里向下掘进。\n\t\t这一技能的冷却时间受岩石身躯的影响。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"166202c9e4ea3524d6cc0a4989172eed907b32e9121101d157b10604e9638a19","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"fca4744a5d514a58af15a314b6f6d6afda7d0bba23c382f759f4135261d70167","logical_entry_identity":"ef6e4f6388cbde0da86d7b39ba0ca53eb2d3e1df8858d20e5221fbfa9ed8e467","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"guard yeti","source_tag":"entity name","target":"雪人守卫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"64dfda3cc019bfa73fd3f4f3ee34e710621247e00fef66fa857f2842ccd5fd1c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"fcb87ed2bc368b40158884cd10f12bc240461741f874a8c08e14fb051ecdd7de","logical_entry_identity":"b0c312b0c4c6908b0c9ea6ab47fe61f247c9939b6f7b8793143381deea50ec41","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The Shunned Kruk","source_tag":"_t","target":"遭排斥的克鲁克部族"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"515573a8b7692de22cf1a720ac4bd79bbf284a82b34cf754bceb90d5a1827c35","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"fcbb3bc7d4661dc7f498ed1bc8e1fa3b8d35d5ef0f3f4446fadbf35311d006a5","logical_entry_identity":"8bd79d63f8c5d27b2e20a5137a06d5d1e5c5264dd89596070a1a0e5cb0b5cdaa","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Destroyed the Sunwall Outpost to secure a way to the mainland.","source_tag":"_t","target":"消灭太阳堡垒前哨站，以确保通往大陆的道路。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"763fa670afcc541eaa19e548026c4c5db08aac5793184a89e67b92100a34f48d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"fce9ce9f8ff2bfd01293edaec2498b6cc8d615da40e05ac4cdc63cbc95b18427","logical_entry_identity":"077996b8156e76f1e4709331a95834f6cd1cb2e07e80c24453d528aff5a652ae","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Class tree: Undead drake","source_tag":"_t","target":"职业技能树：死灵龙"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8e896b48dc6bb969a1a4fa63276eb8117f42e10da1cfcbfe384bb25e